  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHURCH WORK FOR PEACE AND RECONCILIATION IN COLOMBIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One of CAFOD&apos;s principal partners in Colombia, SNPS is the social department of the Colombian Church and a member of the Caritas Network.   Aim: &#x2018;To assist the social and charitable work of the Church in Colombia in order to achieve integral human development and the construction of a new society based on solidarity, justice, peace and respect for human rights, in the light of the Word of God and the social teaching of the Church&#x2019;. SNPS coordinates a network of offices throughout Colombia that seek to promote peace and reconciliation, defend human rights and assist victims of the 50 year conflict. CAFOD also supports the Caritas&#x2019; international advocacy campaign, Peace is Possible in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
